# The build context of server/ember-rooms/docker/Dockerfile: the room
# service's own crates, the helper and its path dependencies, and the C++ the
# room host is built from. Everything else (assets, game build trees, docs)
# stays out so a build sends a few megabytes.
*
!rust/sf4-net/
!server/ember/
!server/ember-rooms/
!server/ember-short/
!server/roomhost/
!src/
**/target/
**/.git/
